00:00:54.687 --> 00:00:55.688
Good to be here.

00:00:55.688 --> 00:00:56.156
Okay, so

00:00:56.156 --> 00:00:57.757
this truly was a moment of truth

00:00:57.757 --> 00:00:59.426
for the Japanese space program.

00:00:59.426 --> 00:01:00.293
Three delays

00:01:00.293 --> 00:01:01.861
