00:03:14.827 --> 00:03:17.096
and hopefully be able to make adjustments

00:03:17.096 --> 00:03:19.532
and avoid any kind of problem.

00:03:19.532 --> 00:03:19.699
Okay.

00:03:19.699 --> 00:03:19.832
Well,

00:03:19.832 --> 00:03:22.402
the main payload was the x ray telescope,

00:03:22.869 --> 00:03:23.336
