00:03:58.304 --> 00:03:59.706
So obviously,

00:03:59.706 --> 00:04:01.507
being the x ray spectrometer,

00:04:01.507 --> 00:04:03.476
it operates in that band,

00:04:03.476 --> 00:04:04.744
in the X-ray band,

00:04:04.744 --> 00:04:05.745
and so it complements

00:04:05.745 --> 00:04:07.213
the other telescopes, the visual,

00:04:07.213 --> 00:04:08.047
